# Derived from the game binary: the CodeView function table and symbol maps,
# the lift statistics, the generated C and the import bridges. Recompiler
# output is never committed (REPO_RULES section 3).
work/
src/recomp/gen/
src/runtime/imports_gen.c
*.i64
*.id0
*.id1
*.id2
*.nam
*.til

